  "Summary": "",
  "TextID": 83657,
  "Text": "RESOLVED, Pursuant to Section 31 of the New York City Charter, the Council hereby approves the appointment by the Mayor of Dave Chokshi as a member of the New York City Board of Health to serve the remainder of a six-year term that will expire on May 31, 2030.\n\nCOUPLED ON GO",
